Here's the problem: I was doing:

```
if (this.state.lastPush && newPush - this.state.lastPush <= THRESHOLD) {
      router.replace(nextSearchState ? `?${string}` : '')
    } else {
      router.push(nextSearchState ? `?${string}` : '')
    }
```

Then set the search state from the location string:

```
<InstantSearch
          indexName={index}
          searchState={qs.parse(location.search.substring(1)}
      ....
```

For some reason this causes an infinite render. I don't think it should.

Edit: for some reason it just keeps being rendered, trying to debug it :/
